resh seafood restaurants. Visitors can enjoy scenic walks, thrilling rides at Wolmi Theme Park, and panoramic views of the city and ocean from Mount Wolmi. The island is easily accessible from downtown Incheon and offers a relaxing escape with cultural attractions, cruises, and vibr","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Incheon","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/%EC%9B%94%EB%AF%B8%EB%8F%84_%EA%B4%80%EA%B4%91%EC%95%88%EB%82%B4%EC%86%8C.jpg/1280px-%EC%9B%94%EB%AF%B8%EB%8F%84_%EA%B4%80%EA%B4%91%EC%95%88%EB%82%B4%EC%86%8C.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/%EC%9B%94%EB%AF%B8%EB%8F%84_%EA%B4%80%EA%B4%91%EC%95%88%EB%82%B4%EC%86%8C.jpg/500px-%EC%9B%94%EB%AF%B8%EB%8F%84_%EA%B4%80%EA%B4%91%EC%95%88%EB%82%B4%EC%86%8C.jpg","w":1200,"h":2131,"author":"Narubaru7","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%EC%9B%94%EB%AF%B8%EB%8F%84_%EA%B4%80%EA%B4%91%EC%95%88%EB%82%B4%EC%86%8C.jpg"}},{"id":"incheon_wolmido","areaId":"incheon","name":"Wolmido","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":37.4751,"lng":126.5995},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"incheon_wolmido","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":2,"commonsNearby":3,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-21"},"hashtags":["wolmido","incheon"],"summary":"Wolmido was a major harbor in Incheon until Yeonan Budu was developed. However, visitors can still do many things in Wolmido. There is a small park, surrounded by a nature walk road. There are also many seafood restaurants and cafes with a great ocean view. What is more, a small harbor that can bring visitors to several islands is still operating. The Chinatown is just a few minutes away, so touri","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Incheon","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/%EC%9B%94%EB%AF%B8%EB%8F%84_%EA%B4%80%EA%B4%91%EC%95%8